               "content": "Orcs are generalized into different subraces. Ogres are creatures living in swamps, known for their extreme violence and colossal strength, characterized by muscular build and towering stature. Orcs, on the other hand, are war-loving and violent, obeying only those with physical strength. They are recognized by their distinctive green skin. Onis possess immense strength, thrive on war, and plunder villages and cities of other races. They are characterized by red, blue, or pink skin pigmentation and two horns protruding from their foreheads.",
